    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536660/extras/0ba1da8cba1319f98e76f23998e1e9b4.avif?t=1749772825\" width=600 height=600 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536660/extras/1fdbc360ff71d406d74322dac6c24caa.avif?t=1749772825\" width=615 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536660/extras/f47b1894c263c2591a46e4874ff090be.webp?t=1749772825\" width=615 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lisa has lost everything. Her gambling addiction has driven her to the brink of despair: no money, drowning in debt, and unable to pay for her sick daughter's treatment, her last hopes fade away. When everything seems lost, she receives a mysterious invitation: a poker game in an isolated house, with a promise of financial help. But the game holds a terrible price\u2014bets are not made with money, but with memories. Lisa must wager her past to win, but how far will she go before losing everything that defines her?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536660/extras/2d89eed9d0d4e69ec068da8ef6b71361.webp?t=1749772825\" width=615 height=60 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Poker of the Soul</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536660/extras/f50f04eaa5816994797d3d4ef6aa1ff8.avif?t=1749772825\" width=614 height=300 /></span>Face a one-of-a-kind poker game: each hand represents a piece of Lisa\u2019s memory. The further you go, the more her past crumbles before your eyes. The real question is: what are you willing to sacrifice for victory?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Exploration and Puzzles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536660/extras/343fdc81c8bc4cb4c8b403c405f7c45b.avif?t=1749772825\" width=614 height=300 /></span>Every room in the house hides a puzzle to solve in order to recover memories. Decipher clues, collect objects, and unlock new areas in an ever-darkening and more unsettling path.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mental Sanity</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536660/extras/9da330aad5932be0bb36ed32e5578134.avif?t=1749772825\" width=614 height=300 /></span>Lisa is haunted by visions of her past. Each memory she bets increases her mental instability. Find ways to stay in control or risk losing the game\u2026 and herself.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Oppressive Atmosphere</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536660/extras/ac482d3d4a740e9bc23da17cdf444a0d.avif?t=1749772825\" width=614 height=300 /></span>A house shrouded in mystery, filled with shadows and unsettling presences. Every room is a fragment of a life slowly falling apart, accompanied by a disturbing soundtrack and eerie ambient sounds.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Elevator of Life</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536660/extras/f9b174bd8c55774be0eca7a370dcec7e.avif?t=1749772825\" width=614 height=300 /></span>Move through Lisa\u2019s memories using the Elevator of Life. Observe and face the floors that compose her memory.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Psychological Narrative</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536660/extras/3b79ef2bb8169ce8e46103aa7f8dfdbd.avif?t=1749772825\" width=614 height=300 /></span>Every lost memory brings Lisa closer to a shocking truth. Has her life been just a series of bad choices, or is there something more?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Memorable Final Twist</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536660/extras/7b0dcdd03eb9199810937a477050a280.avif?t=1749772825\" width=614 height=300 /></span>Like every episode of *Scary Shadow Spot*, *All In* hides a shocking ending that will completely change your perception of the story.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Immersive Graphics and Details</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536660/extras/d952d265347908911edf0e589e801d79.avif?t=1749772825\" width=614 height=300 /></span>Dark lighting, realistic details, and an atmosphere that instills a constant sense of oppression make the experience even more immersive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fear and Constant Tension</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536660/extras/d135a18cec7b80abe3cab586d24d2b35.avif?t=1749772825\" width=614 height=300 /></span>Beware of what lurks in the darkness: the game never stops, and the house is more alive than it seems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536660/extras/70aaafcd7936b07d7649cb9fd027683d.webp?t=1749772825\" width=615 height=60 /></span>Scary Shadow Spot: *All In* is the third chapter in the horror series inspired by *The Twilight Zone*. An experience that will drag you into a psychological nightmare where every choice has a cost, and the line between reality and illusion becomes thinner and thinner.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536660/extras/0ba1da8cba1319f98e76f23998e1e9b4.avif?t=1749772825\" width=600 height=600 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536660/extras/1fdbc360ff71d406d74322dac6c24caa.avif?t=1749772825\" width=615 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536660/extras/f47b1894c263c2591a46e4874ff090be.webp?t=1749772825\" width=615 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lisa has lost everything. Her gambling addiction has driven her to the brink of despair: no money, drowning in debt, and unable to pay for her sick daughter's treatment, her last hopes fade away. When everything seems lost, she receives a mysterious invitation: a poker game in an isolated house, with a promise of financial help. But the game holds a terrible price\u2014bets are not made with money, but with memories. Lisa must wager her past to win, but how far will she go before losing everything that defines her?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536660/extras/2d89eed9d0d4e69ec068da8ef6b71361.webp?t=1749772825\" width=615 height=60 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Poker of the Soul</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536660/extras/f50f04eaa5816994797d3d4ef6aa1ff8.avif?t=1749772825\" width=614 height=300 /></span>Face a one-of-a-kind poker game: each hand represents a piece of Lisa\u2019s memory. The further you go, the more her past crumbles before your eyes. The real question is: what are you willing to sacrifice for victory?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Exploration and Puzzles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536660/extras/343fdc81c8bc4cb4c8b403c405f7c45b.avif?t=1749772825\" width=614 height=300 /></span>Every room in the house hides a puzzle to solve in order to recover memories. Decipher clues, collect objects, and unlock new areas in an ever-darkening and more unsettling path.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mental Sanity</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536660/extras/9da330aad5932be0bb36ed32e5578134.avif?t=1749772825\" width=614 height=300 /></span>Lisa is haunted by visions of her past. Each memory she bets increases her mental instability. Find ways to stay in control or risk losing the game\u2026 and herself.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Oppressive Atmosphere</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536660/extras/ac482d3d4a740e9bc23da17cdf444a0d.avif?t=1749772825\" width=614 height=300 /></span>A house shrouded in mystery, filled with shadows and unsettling presences. Every room is a fragment of a life slowly falling apart, accompanied by a disturbing soundtrack and eerie ambient sounds.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Elevator of Life</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536660/extras/f9b174bd8c55774be0eca7a370dcec7e.avif?t=1749772825\" width=614 height=300 /></span>Move through Lisa\u2019s memories using the Elevator of Life. Observe and face the floors that compos